hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"13","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Ke Aap teen [rakaton] witr padhte the; do rakaton par aisa salam kehte jo hamen sunate, phir khade hote aur ek rakat padhte."
"14","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) [namaz mein] juft [shaf] aur taq [witr] ke darmiyan farq karte hue padhte the; jabke main ghar mein Aap ke salam ko sunti thi."
